{"title":"Halloween Dance Party and Scavenger Hunt","startsAt":"2026-10-31T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T23:59:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**It's a Halloween Dance Party and Scavenger Hunt!**\n\n**Location: Party Room 51 Trolley Crescent**\n**(Scavenger Hunt is under the bridge)**\n\n**Fee:**\n**$20 by October 19th******\n**$25 from October 20th to 28th**\n**Send to**\n**boots4hikingthsix@gmail.com**\n\n**Party Details**\n***Theme**: Unmask your hidden self.*\n*** Vibe*: Grown-up drinks, killer costumes, and zero filters.\n\n**Drop the mask and let your true monster out to play this Halloween.**\nPrize for best costume!\nEvery day we wear the mask of the professional, the polite, and the responsible. Not tonight. This Halloween, it’s time to shed your civilized skin and unleash your **real personality**—no filters, no judgements, just pure, unadulterated fun.\nCome as who you *actually* are on the inside.\n🖤 The Ritual\n\n*** Date: **Saturday, October 31st, 2026\n*** Time: **7:00 PM until the spirits fade**\n*** Lair: We are just confirming the venue. We will keep you posted!\n\n🍷 The Elements\n\n*** Potions & Brews: **Drinks and nibbles provided!\n*** Attire: **Costumes required. Dress as your inner alter-ego, your deepest obsession, or the version of you that only comes out after dark.\n*** The Vibe: **Dark beats, heavy pours, and wicked company.\nADMISSION IS $20,\n\nAre you brave enough to show your true colours?","venue":{"name":"51 Trolley Crescent","address":"51 Trolley Cres, Toronto, ON M5A 0E9, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.656982,"lng":-79.35538,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"These Boots Are Made for Hiking","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/7/0/2/highres_535910946.jpeg"}